te Designer (Advanced Junior Designer)\nTHCG Associate Designer/Advanced Junior Designer\nWe offer a competitive salary and... ...The Healthcare Group Company is specifically designated for interior renovations of Subacute & Skilled Nursing Healthcare. The Construction..."}], "k": []}, "b87b5ea99e": {"s": [{"h": null, "t": "...Mid-Level Interior Designer\nWendel is a nationally recognized Architecture, Engineering, Energy Efficiency, and Construction Management firm partnering with public and private clients to deliver thoughtful, integrated solutions for facility and infrastructure projects..."}], "k": ["construction-administration"]}, "30055d3dfa": {"s": [{"h": null, "t": "... Interior Designer\nMinneapolis, Minnesota, United States\nDLR Group is an integrated design firm with a promise to elevate the human experience through design. This fuels the work we do around the world and inspires our mission to improve the lives of our clients,..."}], "k": []}, "1905fdef34": {"s": [{"h": null, "t": "... Interior Designer\nCairn Collaborative Design-Build's Interior Designer is responsible for guiding residential clients through the interior design process from concept through execution in close coordination with the architectural and build teams. This role requires..."}], "k": []}, "8f73bdf822": {"s": [{"h": null, "t": "... Interior Designer II\nAt ADG Blatt, we are guided by our core values of trust, creativity, collaboration, accountability, learning, and kindness. With 50 years of positive impact on Oklahoma's built environment, we are a multidisciplinary architecture, engineering, and..."}], "k": []}, "24f76948db": {"s": [{"h": null, "t": "... Interior Designer Opportunity\nHoyt Architects is seeking a talented and motivated Interior Designer to join our collaborative, design-driven studio. This role offers the opportunity to work on thoughtful, context-sensitive projects alongside a multidisciplinary team..."}], "k": []}, "d45979f60a": {"s": [{"h": null, "t": "...spa