}, "c72fbfaff6": {"s": [{"h": null, "t": "... Interior Designer III\nThe Interior Designer III is responsible for guiding the project team through all phases of the design process with a high level of ownership, creativity, and technical expertise. This individual plays a key role in project execution, client relationships..."}], "k": ["account-management"]}, "7ee139a67b": {"s": [{"h": null, "t": "... Interior Designer\nPay: $60,000.00 - $70,000.00 per year"}, {"h": "Job description", "t": "About Us - M. Designs Architects is an award-winning architecture, planning, and interior design firm based in Mountain View, California. We specialize in sustainable, residential design..."}], "k": []}, "5e25300c6f": {"s": [{"h": null, "t": "Mēs meklējam pieredzējušu un motivētu Studijas interjera dizaineri! Šī ir patiesi aizraujoša iespēja talantīgam indivīdam, kurš vēlas veidot karjeru dinamiskā un starptautiskā darba vidē."}, {"h": "Pienākumi", "t": "Veikt visus dizaina posmus no koncepcijas līdz galaproduktam;\nIzstrādāt dizaina uzdevumus, kas atbilst klienta mērķim;\nIzveidot studijas interjera dizaina specifikācijas;\nSagatavot dizaina failus drukāšanai un ražošanai;\nPabeigt projektus, koordinējot ar iekšējām komandām, ārējām aģentūrām, ražošanas pakalpojumiem, piegādātājiem;\nUzraudzīt iepirkuma procesus un nodrošināt kvalitātes standartus;\nUzraudzīt studijas būvniecību;\nNovērtēt laiku, kas nepieciešams darba pabeigšanai;\nPabeigt darbu pirms termiņa;\nProfesionāli pieiet izmaksām un termiņiem;\nPiedalīties komandas sapulcēs un ideju ģenerēšanas sesijās.\nWe are now looking for an experienced and driven Studio Interior Designer! This is truly an exciting opportunity for a talented individual looking for a career in a dynamic and international work environment."}, {"h": "Key Responsibilities", "t": "Execute all design stages from concept to final product;\nDevelop design briefs that suit the client’s purpose;\nCreate studio interior design specifications;\nPrepare design files for print and production;\nComplete projects by coordinating with internal teams, outside agencies, production services, suppliers;\nSupervise procurement processes and assure quality standards;\nSupervise studio-build;\nEstimate the time required to complete the work;\nComplete work prior to deadlines;\nHave a professional approach to costs and deadlines;\nParticipate in team meetings and brainstorming sessions."}, {"h": "Prasības", "t": "Programmatūras zināšanas: AutoCad, Photoshop,Corona Render;\nIzglītība: Mākslas bakalaurs un/vai interjera dizains;\nPieredze ilustrācijā, animācijā vai saistītā jomā tiks uzskatīta par priekšrocību;\nAdobe: After Effects, Premiere tiks uzskatīta par priekšrocību;\nZināšanas par mākslīgā intelekta (MI) darbinātiem dizaina rīkiem tiks uzskatītas par priekšrocību, nepieciešama vēlme un spēja apgūt un integrēt MI rīkus dizaina izstrādes procesā;\nAugsta līmeņa angļu valodas prasmes, gan rakstiski, gan mutiski - darbam ar uzņēmuma iekšējām sistēmām un ikdienas saziņai ar citiem starptautiskajiem departamentiem;\nPašmotivācija, izcilas komunikācijas prasmes un lieliska komandas spēlētāja attieksme.\nPriekšrocība - prasmes, kas būs jāapgūst šīs lomas ietvaros: Veidot augstas kvalitātes 3D modeļus un renderus izmantojot 3ds Max."}, {"h": "Qualifications", "t": "Knowledge of software: AutoCad, Photoshop, Corona Render;"}, {"h": "Education: Bachelor of Arts and/or Interior design;", "t": "Experience in Illustration, Animation, or related field will be considered as advantage;\nAdobe: After effects, Premiere will be considered as advantage;\nKnowledge of AI-powered design tools is an advantage, willingness and ability to learn and integrate AI tools into the design workflow is required;\nAdvanced English, both written and verbal - to work with the company's internal systems and daily communicate with other international departments;\nSelf-motivation, excellent communication skills, and a great team-player attitude.\nAdvantage – skills that will need to be developed as part of the role: Create high-quality 3D models and renders using 3ds Max."}, {"h": "Mēs piedāvājam", "t": "Bruto mēnešalga 2400-3200 EUR /bruto;\nAugstākās klases tehniskais aprīkojums;\nDinamiska organizācija starptautiskā vidē;\nPrasmīgi un izpalīdzīgi kolēģi;\nPersonīgās un profesionālās attīstības darbnīcas;\nMūsdienīgs, augsto tehnoloģiju birojs ar ērtu piekļuvi sabiedriskajam transportam, autostāvvietu automašīnām un velosipēdiem, kā arī elektrisko skūteru uzlādes staciju;\nVeselības apdrošināšana, ieskaitot zobārstu, garīgās un fiziskās veselības atbalstu un citas priekšrocības;\nUz vietas esoša sporta zāle ar grupu treniņiem;\nGalda teniss, galda futbols un citas spēles aktīvām pauzēm, dažādi iekšējie pasākumi un ballītes;\nPriviliģētā karte (lojalitātes programma);\nŠis amats ir uz noteiktu laiku, aizvietojot darbinieci bērna kopšanas atvaļinājuma laikā."}, {"h": "Gross monthly salary of 2400-3200 EUR /gross;", "t": "Top-notch tech equipment;\nDynamic organization in international environment;\nSkilled and helpful colleagues;\nPersonal and professional development workshops;\nModern, high-tech office with easy access by public transport, parking for cars and bicycles, and electric scooter charging station;\nHealth insurance including a dentist, mental and physical health support and other benefits;\nOn-site gym with group trainings;\nPing Pong, foosball & other games for active breaks, various internal events and parties;\nPrivilege card (Loyalty program);\nThis position is a fixed-term role covering a maternity leave period."}], "k": ["3d-modeling", "3ds-max", "after-effects", "autocad", "illustration", "motion-design", "photoshop", "procurement", "rendering"], "b": ["health-insurance", "parental-leave"], "r": {"lang": ["English"]}}, "66d5744dbe": {"s": [{"h": "Responsibilities", "t": "Execute all design stages from concept to final product,\nDevelop design briefs that suit the client’s purpose,\nProduce high quality 3D models and renders,\nCreate studio interior design specifications,\nPrepare design files for print and production,\nComplete projects by coordinating with internal teams, outside agencies, production services, suppliers,\nSupervise procurement processes and assure quality standards,\nSupervise studio-build,\nEstimate the time required to complete the work,\nComplete work prior to deadlines,\nHave a professional approach to costs and deadlines,\nParticipate in team meetings and brainstorming sessions\nIn order to continue in the selection process, you will have to submit a portfolio."}, {"h": "Education: Bachelor of Arts and/or Interior design,", "t": "Knowledge of software: 3dsmax, AutoCad, Photoshop, Illustrator, Corona Render,\nExperience in Illustration, Animation, or related field will be considered as advantage,\nAdobe: After effects, Premiere will be considered as advantage,\nAdvanced English, both written and verbal,\nSelf-motivation, excellent communication skills, and a great team-player attitude\nExperience integrating AI tools into the design process to enhance creativity, efficiency, and overall project delivery\nEsta posición es una excelente oportunidad para unirse al equipo de Evolution, una empresa de rápido crecimiento, trabajamos 100% presencial en Tigo Sede Principal, Rivana Business Park – Cra. 48 #20-45"}, {"h": "Además, ofrecemos", "t": "Capacitación completa y oportunidades de crecimiento;\nDesarrollo profesional y personal: para la persona adecuada, existe la posibilidad de que el rol crezca en responsabilidades;\nMás información en Evolution.com.\n\"Proceso inclusivo y libre de discriminación: En Evolution Development Colombia promovemos la igualdad de oportunidades. Las personas con cualquier tipo de discapacidad pueden postularse en cualquiera de las etapas del proceso, siempre que cumplan los requisitos del cargo. Si requieres ajustes razonables para participar en el proceso (por ejemplo: accesibilidad, intérprete, tiempo adicional, formatos alternativos), por favor indícalo al postularte o escribe a +57 324 2643954 \"\""}], "k": ["3d-modeling", "3ds-max", "after-effects", "autocad", "illustration", "motion-design", "photoshop", "procurement", "project-management", "rendering"]}}